  "name": "ContractingObserved",
  "description": "Reads of contracting observed (issue #6): s[i] = \u03a3_k u[i,k]\u00b2 read under a faq over (i,k) that binds the same k (the capture case), squared (chain rule through the nested sum) and times the local cell; plus a scalar observed whose sum is not its root, c = 2\u00b7\u03a3_k u[1,k]. Each inlines to a nested scalar faq renamed apart from the reader's k; the column-reading sites become contracted band dimensions (spec \u00a73.5)."
